prob 0
==================================================

loan of $40k, 5.25% anual-compound interest
How many years until $72k+
Give the smallest whole-number solution.

~~40000 * 5.25^x >= 72000~~
40000 * 1.0525^x >= 72000

1.0525^x >= 72/40

log_2(8) = 3
2^3 = 8

x >= log_1.0525(72/40)
x >= ~11.48732358
x = 12

40 * 1.0525^12 >= 72      (b'-')b
40 * 1.0525^11 < 72       ( '-')b


